  "root": "u3",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 5,
      "text": "Dear,",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 7,
      "end": 21,
      "text": "Sate Senator ,",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 23,
      "end": 62,
      "text": "We need to keep the Electoral College .",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 63,
      "end": 95,
      "text": "It clearly states in paragraph 1",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 96,
      "end": 137,
      "text": "why we need to keep the Electoral College",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "start": 138,
      "end": 166,
      "text": "there are so many reason why",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 167,
      "end": 218,
      "text": "but only one can bring it to staying in the system.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 218,
      "end": 263,
      "text": "\"Electoale College is a process, not a place.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 264,
      "end": 458,
      "text": "The founding fathers established it in the constitution as a comprise between election of the President by vote in Congress and elction of the President by a polular vite of quarified citizens\".",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 459,
      "end": 551,
      "text": "What i am clearly trying to state is the the Elecotoral College needs to stay in the system.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 553,
      "end": 583,
      "text": "Many people will say different",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 584,
      "end": 645,
      "text": "but only in my opinion we need ot keep the Elcectral College,",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 646,
      "end": 707,
      "text": "it is part of the Constitution of the United Sates of America",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 708,
      "end": 782,
      "text": "if it clearly staes stuff about the Electoal College in the Consistitution",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 783,
      "end": 917,
      "text": "then that means you need to keep it in the sistem to help with all the dier need that the world has to offer for the Electoral College",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 918,
      "end": 955,
      "text": "just dont get rid of it for no reason",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 956,
      "end": 1030,
      "text": "you need to have a really great suggestion to remove it out of the system.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 1032,
      "end": 1076,
      "text": "All i am trying to say is that in my opinion",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 1077,
      "end": 1096,
      "text": "if you care at all,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18b",
      "start": 1097,
      "end": 1144,
      "text": "the we need to keep the Electoral College alive",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u20",
      "start": 1145,
      "end": 1177,
      "text": "dont just kick it out the system",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u21",
      "start": 1178,
      "end": 1218,
      "text": "if it sates its name in the Constitution",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u22",
      "start": 1219,
      "end": 1252,
      "text": "then it need to stay where its at",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u23",
      "start": 1253,
      "end": 1283,
      "text": "dont delte it from the program",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u24",
      "start": 1284,
      "end": 1319,
      "text": "just becauss of some stupid process",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "rejected",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u25",
      "start": 1320,
      "end": 1360,
      "text": "you need a darn good reason to remove it",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u26",
      "start": 1361,
      "end": 1394,
      "text": "not just because you feel like it",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "rejected",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u27",
      "start": 1395,
      "end": 1416,
      "text": "thats not good enough",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u28",
      "start": 1417,
      "end": 1496,
      "text": "you need to show emotion about how the Electoral College is in the Constisution",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u29",
      "start": 1498,
      "end": 1553,
      "text": "Please look at my reason in why to keep it in the sytem",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u30",
      "start": 1554,
      "end": 1580,
      "text": "thank you so greatly much.",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u31",
      "start": 1581,
      "end": 1610,
      "text": "Just take me up on my opinion",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u32",
      "start": 1611,
      "end": 1647,
      "text": "i am usally right in cases like this",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u33",
      "start": 1648,
      "end": 1687,
      "text": "i show great emotion in stuff like this",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u34",
      "start": 1688,
      "end": 1727,
      "text": "all you need to do is look at the facts",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u35",
      "start": 1728,
      "end": 1803,
      "text": "and you will see why i want the it to stay moving and not to be kicked out.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
